peaker":"Dave","turn_index":22},{"dia_id":"D24:23","global_turn_index":424,"locator":"[S24T23]","raw_turn_sha256":"0ecd9533eff1f25190bccf952bb1406ebe69fff641a45350825cce3863766c58","rendered_turn_sha256":"dc5d8a22ddef1752d1648f3d79ddefeb31d5b7a5d363282c500846cab1f80ec9","session_date":"2023-10-19","session_datetime":"2023-10-19T10:11:00","session_id":"session_24","session_index":24,"source_sha256":"ceb6992278d8c2721261cd39b4c1c08091de20f7b8ce7a6f788b390e272d7537","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":23}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Calvin: Thanks, Dave! I'm so excited you'll be at one of our shows. It's such a great experience, you'll definitely enjoy it! Look at this crowd, that was insane!\n[Image caption: a photo of a large crowd of people in a large auditorium]\n[S24T7] (dia_id: D24:7)\n\nDave: That sounds really exciting! Can't wait to experience it. I'm sure everyone in the crowd is going to be pumped up!\n[S24T8] (dia_id: D24:8)\n\nCalvin: Wow, the crowd energy is amazing! It always gets me so pumped and it's awesome. Look at that photo, that was awesome!\n[Image caption: a photography of a crowd of people at a concert with their hands in the air]\n[S24T9] (dia_id: D24:9)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin, that's an awesome pic! Everyone looks so pumped. Where was that taken?\n[S24T10] (dia_id: D24:10)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! That pic was taken in Tokyo during a concert. Man, the energy was nuts - felt like the whole city came out!\n[S24T11] (dia_id: D24:11)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin, Tokyo looks incredible! Here's a pic I found online, and it's making me dream about visiting someday. The energy there seems unbeatable! Have you ever visited streets like that?\n[Image caption: a photo of a busy street with people walking and shopping]\n[S24T12] (dia_id: D24:12)\n\nCalvin: Yes, Dave! That was an incredible experience to visit similar streets like you shared in your photo. Is there anything else that interests you in Tokyo?\n[S24T13] (dia_id: D24:13)\n\nDave: Of course, Calvin! Tokyo is amazing! I want to know everything about it - the people, the culture, the food, take a walk at the vibrant city life! In the photo below, the city is so alive and colorful that's impressive! It will be an unforgettable experience!\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowded street at night with people walking and walking]\n[S24T14] (dia_id: D24:14)\n\nCalvin: That photo's a great pic! The lights, the people - so lively! Can't wait to hear your emotions when you see that in person!\n[S24T15] (dia_id: D24:15)\n\nDave: It's really amazing. Hope I'll get to see it in person soon!\n[S24T16] (dia_id: D24:16)\n\nCalvin: Cool, Dave! I'm actually going to Tokyo next month after the tour ends. Sometimes I wish I could go back to places like the one in the photo below. What a great view!\n[Image caption: a photo of a city at night with a tall building in the background]\n[S24T17] (dia_id: D24:17)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! That's great to hear! Any specific spots in Tokyo that you're really excited to check out?\n[S24T18] (dia_id: D24:18)\n\nCalvin: Yeah definitely! Shibuya Crossing is like Tokyo's Times Square, and I was excited to explore Shinjuku. Plus, there's amazing food there, can't wait to try it again! Look at the photo of Shibuya Crossing at night, that's amazing!\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowd of people with umbrellas in the rain]\n[S24T19] (dia_id: D24:19)\n\nDave: Shibuya and Shinjuku are cool spots! The food in Tokyo is great, I'll have so much fun exploring all the different places. Have you tried ramen yet? Here's a photo of a ramen bowl that I tried in Boston, it was delicious, but i think in Tokyo it will be even better!\n[Image caption: a photo of a bowl of soup with broccoli and noodles]\n[S24T20] (dia_id: D24:20)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! Never tried it, but it's supposed to be awesome. Gonna give it a shot while in Tokyo!\n[S24T21] (dia_id: D24:21)\n\nDave: Do it, Calvin! Once you try it, you'll never go back. Bon voyage and have fun!\n[S24T22] (dia_id: D24:22)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! I'll definitely give it a shot. Appreciate the encouragement! See you soon, bye!\n[S24T23] (dia_id: D24:23)","text_sha256":"a30bb862fd7275c208a93ef502b3ccf35500206d7920c3067a016617e23ca619","timestamp":"2023-10-19T10:11:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":408,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":13204,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":13612},"model":{"requested_model":"x-test-2","served_models":["deepseek-v4.1-flash"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"refind-appendix-a-stage1-plus-temporal-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"20422063cc471ee1de75c38e4250e1a141a731ea2970786a6c715dc3c83cf7de"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"What dish does Dave recommend Calvin to try in Tokyo?","question_id":"conv-50-q129","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-dev6-v1","run_position":1,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"be1bbaba38c6957ce23b688960fef2a567f0a626682ed4580f02e4dc7af7d5c0","runtime_contract":{"evidence_budget_limit":16000,"evidence_budget_unit":"characters","round_limit":4,"runtime_sha256":"ed611d544fa61c307748e870b8f9826deebb5bd1a3ab35b5ef999b6ad651ab17"},"schema_version":1,"search_actions":[{"action":"search_chatrecord","arguments":{"keywords":["Dave","Calvin","Tokyo","